    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it seems like the whole movement was basically just about workers standing up to corporate greed to make things fair. do you think the main reason the middle class grew so much was because of that direct confrontation with big business, or were there other factors that played a role?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
